<title>UK: BHF Bank sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</title>
<headline>BHF Bank sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BHF Bank AG said it has issued 10</p>
<p>million European-style call warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   *AT-THE-MONEY	    PREMIUM 8.5 PCT(APROX)</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.95 DEM (APROX)	LISTING	FFURT</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	30.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	=</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
